  - statementId: 3
    basicConversation:
    - id: 3
      conversation: Of Course! Just use these lockers whenever you want. However, please do not utilize all these locker spaces by yourself alright? Try to stick to one locker space for yourself. Just store items that you want to keep for future use inside your locker. In case you need more space for your locker, you need to spend a portion of your money for that arrangement.
